p to sell second half at $9.60 lmt gtc-- Set stop at new $6.00, good after =
10:30 a.m. ET only*NEW RECOMMENDATIONApplied Materials (AMAT) February 105 =
calls-- Symbol: AMAT210219C00105000-- Order: Buy at $3.30 lmt day only-- If=
 filled, set up to sell half at $4.30 lmt gtc and half at $5.60 lmt gtc-- I=
